1
00:00:02,238 --> 00:00:04,189
As Uke strikes de center of your head

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:06,042
slide forward controlling his arm,

3
00:00:06,043 --> 00:00:09,632
as you make contact turn the hip sharply
to break his balance,

4
00:00:09,933 --> 00:00:14,440
controlling his wrist and fingers
step forward taking his balance,

5
00:00:14,441 --> 00:00:16,051
switch to the other hand

6
00:00:16,052 --> 00:00:17,945
come around the front controlling his elbow

7
00:00:17,946 --> 00:00:19,723
drawing Uke´s body towards you

8
00:00:21,024 --> 00:00:22,430
as you place him down,

9
00:00:22,831 --> 00:00:25,323
place Uke´s shoulder between your knees,

10
00:00:25,324 --> 00:00:28,183
switch the grip to the opposite hand

11
00:00:28,184 --> 00:00:30,106
placing that wrist against your shoulder

12
00:00:30,107 --> 00:00:33,410
holding it tight
turning your body towards his head for the pin.

